"t": "Beuschlein F et al. ESE/Endocrine Society Clinical Practice Guideline: Diagnosis and therapy of glucocorticoid-induced adrenal insufficiency. Eur J Endocrinol 2024;190(5):G25–G51",
"u": "https://academic.oup.com/ejendo/article/190/5/G25/7663654"
